        "id": "nangong_yu-basic_attack-adorable_explosive_impact",
        "name": "Adorable Explosive Impact (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "Hold [BASIC] to launch a charged attack, dealing Ether DMG. Release the button at the right moment to trigger precise charging, increasing the Daze dealt by the skill by 20%.\n\nNangong Yu can perform up to three hits. The second and third hits each must consume 50 /bDownbeats//b.\n\nAfter using a /bChain Attack//b, /bUltimate//b, or /bEX Special Attack//b, if enough /bDownbeats//b are available, hold [BASIC] to skip the first hit and directly perform the second and third hits, which always trigger precise charging.\n\nWhen Nangong Yu is the active character, /bChain Attacks//b, /bUltimates//b, and /bEX Special Attacks//b do not interrupt the combo count of /bBasic Attack: Adorable Explosive Impact//b. While charging the first hit, Anti-Interrupt Level increases and DMG taken decreases by 60%.\n\nWhile charging the second and third hits, the character is Invulnerable. During the dash phase of the first hit, enemy attacks can be Blocked. On a successful Block, the attack is treated as a precise charging attack. Character is invulnerable during all attacks.",
